msgstr "Kredensial API CHIP Send tidak dikonfigurasi."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:1339
msgid ""
"CHIP Send API credentials are not set yet — payouts are disabled until they "
"are configured."
msgstr ""
"Kredensial API CHIP Send belum ditetapkan — pembayaran dilumpuhkan sehingga "
"ia dikonfigurasi."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-api.php:183
msgid "CHIP Send API error (HTTP %1$s): %2$s"
msgstr "Ralat API CHIP Send (HTTP %1$s): %2$s"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-api.php:195
msgid "CHIP Send API returned an unexpected response."
msgstr "API CHIP Send memulangkan respons yang tidak dijangka."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:554
msgid "CHIP Send Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi CHIP Send"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:790
msgid ""
"CHIP Send delivers %s payout status updates to this site, and every delivery"
" is verified against the public key for that webhook. Registration is "
"automatic — nothing to configure here."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send menghantar kemas kini status pembayaran %s ke laman ini, dan "
"setiap penghantaran disahkan menggunakan kunci awam bagi webhook tersebut. "
"Pendaftaran adalah automatik — tiada apa yang perlu dikonfigurasikan di "
"sini."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-bank-accounts.php:452
msgid "CHIP Send did not return a bank account ID."
msgstr "CHIP Send tidak memulangkan ID akaun bank."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:409
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:1405
msgid "CHIP Send did not return a send instruction ID."
msgstr "CHIP Send tidak memulangkan ID arahan penghantaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:302
msgid "CHIP Send did not return a webhook ID."
msgstr "CHIP Send tidak memulangkan ID webhook."

#: chip-for-affiliatewp.php:67
msgid ""
"CHIP Send for AffiliateWP needs AffiliateWP to be installed and active. "
"Payouts stay disabled until it is."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send untuk AffiliateWP memerlukan AffiliateWP dipasang dan aktif. "
"Pembayaran kekal dilumpuhkan sehingga ia dipasang."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:509
msgid ""
"CHIP Send has put these instructions under review. They will not complete on"
" their own — contact your CHIP account manager and quote the instruction ID."
" The affiliates have not been paid yet."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send telah meletakkan arahan ini di bawah semakan. Ia tidak akan "
"selesai sendiri — hubungi pengurus akaun CHIP anda dan nyatakan ID arahan "
"tersebut. Afiliasi belum dibayar lagi."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:790
msgid "CHIP Send instruction %1$s. %2$s"
msgstr "Arahan penghantaran CHIP Send %1$s. %2$s"

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:1166
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:1178
msgid ""
"CHIP Send is in Test Mode — payouts go to the CHIP Send staging environment "
"and no real money moves."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send dalam Mod Ujian — pembayaran pergi ke persekitaran staging CHIP "
"Send dan tiada wang sebenar dipindahkan."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-webhooks.php:173
msgid "CHIP Send payout method is not enabled."
msgstr "Kaedah pembayaran CHIP Send tidak diaktifkan."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:1167
#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:1179
msgid ""
"CHIP Send pays each affiliate directly to their bank account. Payouts stay "
"in Processing until CHIP confirms the transfer, then the referral is marked "
"Paid."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send membayar setiap afiliasi terus ke akaun bank mereka. Pembayaran "
"kekal dalam status Memproses sehingga CHIP mengesahkan pemindahan, kemudian "
"rujukan ditanda Dibayar."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-payouts.php:204
msgid ""
"CHIP Send pays out in MYR only, but this store is set to %s. Change the "
"currency in AffiliateWP settings to send payouts."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send hanya membayar dalam MYR, tetapi kedai ini ditetapkan kepada %s. "
"Tukar mata wang dalam tetapan AffiliateWP untuk menghantar pembayaran."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-affiliate-area.php:244
msgid ""
"CHIP Send verifies the account before your next payout. You will be paid as "
"soon as verification completes."
msgstr ""
"CHIP Send mengesahkan akaun sebelum pembayaran seterusnya. Anda akan dibayar"
" sebaik sahaja pengesahan selesai."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-admin.php:1366
msgid ""
"CHIP Send webhook is not set up yet (%1$s). Payouts still work — statuses "
"are requeried hourly — but confirmations arrive faster with the webhook."
msgstr ""
"Webhook CHIP Send belum disediakan (%1$s). Pembayaran tetap berfungsi — "
"status disemak setiap jam — tetapi pengesahan lebih pantas dengan webhook."

#: includes/class-chip-affiliatewp-failures.php:132
msgid ""
"Check the API key and secret under Settings → Payouts → CHIP Send, and "
"confirm the key is still active in your CHIP account."
msgstr ""
"Semak kunci API dan rahsia di Settings → Payouts → CHIP Send, dan pastikan "
"kunci itu masih aktif dalam akaun CHIP anda."

